tar cheatsheet:

! files or directories cannot be aded to compressed .tar.gz or .tar.bz2. also cannot be verified

== CREATE ==
options:
-c  create
-v  verbose progress
-z  zip with gz 
-j  zip with bz2
-f  filename

>> oneliner without compression
tar -cvf allOldStuff.tar old-folder/

>> oneliner compressed
tar -cvzf allOldStuff.tar.gz old-folder/


== ADD ==
-- directory --
tar -rvf allOldStuff.tar example/

-- file --
tar -rvf allOldStuff.tar example.jpg


== EXTRACT ==
-- everything --
tar -xvf allOldStuff.tar

>> different directory
tar -xvf allOldStuff.tar -C /home/another-folder/

-- some --
>> uncompressed
tar -xvf allOldStuff.tar example.sh

>> compressed
tar -zxvf allOldStuff.tar.gz example.sh

-- selected files --
tar -xvf allOldStuff.tar "file1.sh" "file2.sh"

-- filtered --
tar -xvf allOldStuff.tar --wildcards '*.jpg'


== VIEW ==
tar -tvf allOldStuff.tar


== VERIFY ==
tar -tvf allOldStuff.tar

-- verify size --
tar -czf - allOldStuff.tar | wc -c
